{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit"]]},"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Guides","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StateManagement","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ThemingGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusSystem","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/AppearanceAndColors","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Preferences","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/CustomViews","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/KeyboardShortcuts","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PaletteReference","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ListAndTable","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/LayoutSystem"],"anchor":"Guides"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"API Collection","modules":[{"name":"TUIkit"}],"role":"collectionGroup","title":"Image Decoding"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PlatformImageLoader","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" uses vendored, namespaced pure Swift format decoders and always returns non-premultiplied 8-bit RGBA pixels in an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RGBAImage","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Animated images and formats other than PNG and JPEG are not supported. JPEG input is limited to 8-bit grayscale and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"three-component color images."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The format decoder is independent from file and URL lifecycle code. Decoding the same bytes with the same limits therefore produces the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"same pixels without accessing the network.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Loading-Data-or-Files","level":2,"text":"Loading Data or Files"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let loader = PlatformImageLoader()","let fromData = try loader.loadImage(from: encodedData)","let fromFile = try loader.loadImage(from: \"\/absolute\/path\/image.png\")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Both entry points apply the same validation and return ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageLoadError","type":"reference"},{"text":" when the input cannot be read or decoded.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Resource-Limits","level":2,"text":"Resource Limits"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Configure "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageDecodingLimits"},{"type":"text","text":" when creating the loader:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let limits = ImageDecodingLimits(","    maxInputBytes: 8 * 1_024 * 1_024,","    maxDimension: 4_096,","    maxPixelCount: 12_000_000,","    maxFrameCount: 1,","    maxDecodedBytes: 48 * 1_024 * 1_024,","    maxDecompressedBytes: 48 * 1_024 * 1_024",")","let loader = PlatformImageLoader(limits: limits)"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TUIkit inspects the image header and validates encoded bytes, dimensions, pixels, frames, decompressed source samples, and the final RGBA"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"allocation before invoking a format decoder. A per-call "},{"code":"maxPixelCount","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" can tighten the loader-wide pixel limit but cannot loosen it."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"PNG ancillary metadata is discarded because "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RGBAImage"},{"type":"text","text":" has no metadata surface. This also prevents compressed text or color-profile"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"chunks from allocating outside the image decompression limit. PNG image-data chunks are fed to the decoder in bounded pieces, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"malformed trailing decompressed data is rejected."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"URL loading streams encoded bytes and cancels the transfer as soon as ","type":"text"},{"code":"maxInputBytes","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is exceeded. Cached images are revalidated against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the current loader’s dimensions, pixels, frame, and final allocation limits before they are returned.","type":"text"}]}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Load static PNG and JPEG images safely on macOS and Linux.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"topicSections":[{"title":"Loading","anchor":"Loading","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PlatformImageLoader","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageLoader"]},{"title":"Data and Limits","anchor":"Data-and-Limits","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageDecodingLimits","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RGBAImage","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RGBA","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageLoadError"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageDecoding","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/tuikit\/imagedecoding"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"tuikit-logo.png":{"identifier":"tuikit-logo.png","alt":"TUIkit Logo","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/TUIkit\/tuikit-logo.png"}],"type":"image"},"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit":{"type":"topic","title":"TUIkit","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A declarative, SwiftUI-like framework for building Terminal User Interfaces in Swift."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/tuikit","role":"collection","images":[{"type":"icon",